WEBVTT

00:25.920 --> 00:27.120
Hey. Newbie.

00:27.264 --> 00:29.040
How's your stomach?

00:29.344 --> 00:31.232
Better. Thanks.

00:31.728 --> 00:34.208
Glad to hear it.

00:34.784 --> 00:38.832
By the way, is that the convict you mentioned?

00:39.248 --> 00:43.648
Yeah. He's usually obedient,
though he doesn't look it.

00:45.851 --> 00:49.056
That's the murderer who shook
the imperial capital.

00:49.392 --> 00:52.880
Hugo Coppelia the Puppeteer.

02:29.225 --> 02:31.913
Two laps around the city walls.

02:32.241 --> 02:35.233
Finish within two hours with weights on.

02:35.521 --> 02:37.489
That's my morning routine.

02:37.888 --> 02:40.624
I've never skipped it, no matter how tired I am.

02:44.160 --> 02:47.536
Get up, Noel! Beasts won't wait on you!

02:48.784 --> 02:49.640
Too slow!

02:51.376 --> 02:56.656
The day I declared I would be a Seeker,
my training began.

02:56.960 --> 03:00.016
The gentle grandfather I knew
was nowhere to be seen.

03:00.304 --> 03:02.816
He put me through rigorous training every day.

03:05.984 --> 03:09.024
Talkers aren't capable of
strengthening themselves.

03:09.536 --> 03:12.912
So in order to survive as a Seeker…

03:32.576 --> 03:34.208
I have more in me!

03:47.248 --> 03:49.536
You have such a nice body.

03:50.080 --> 03:52.528
It's… unfortunate.

03:52.969 --> 03:53.977
Unfortunate?

03:55.232 --> 03:59.226
That you have to put in effort for that body.

03:59.296 --> 04:04.704
And no matter how hard you train,
you'll never be as good as a frontline Job.

04:05.664 --> 04:09.296
Hard work can never catch up to inborn talent.

04:21.008 --> 04:22.624
Nice room you have here.

04:23.168 --> 04:25.984
How about you? Have you settled in?

04:26.304 --> 04:30.352
Pretty much. It's not a bad room,
although not as nice as this.

04:30.720 --> 04:32.432
As long as you're comfortable.

04:33.008 --> 04:35.054
It's not the time we agreed on yet.

04:35.152 --> 04:36.416
You're rather early.

04:37.904 --> 04:40.176
Happy to see your big sister early?

04:41.824 --> 04:42.430
Hey.

04:42.656 --> 04:43.792
Let me touch you.

04:48.929 --> 04:50.800
I don't recall consenting.

04:51.970 --> 04:52.866
Stop it!

04:52.920 --> 04:54.520
Can't. Accept your fate.

04:55.280 --> 04:56.671
Get your hands off me!

04:57.008 --> 04:58.704
So strong…

04:59.929 --> 05:04.384
It's no use. No little brother
can beat his big sister.

05:04.648 --> 05:07.792
Like I said, you're not my sis…

05:09.164 --> 05:11.888
You're so cute when you get desperate!

05:12.016 --> 05:12.880
Can I give you a kiss?

05:14.032 --> 05:15.280
I'm gonna smooch you!

05:18.330 --> 05:22.736
It's too early for this, tits-for-brains!

05:25.195 --> 05:30.128
How dare you hit a girl in the head?
A flick on the forehead is the most that's okay.

05:30.448 --> 05:33.600
That's rich from someone who
tried to assault me first thing in the morning.

05:34.704 --> 05:37.120
It's your fault for being cute
first thing in the morning.

05:37.393 --> 05:38.993
What kind of logic is that?

05:46.880 --> 05:48.624
We're going on a date today!

05:49.072 --> 05:50.784
Where will you take me?

05:51.408 --> 05:54.944
Alright. Our first stop
is the Appraiser Association.

05:55.328 --> 05:58.496
You can get Job appraisals and rank up here.

05:59.568 --> 06:01.408
Appraiser is a special kind of Job.

06:02.304 --> 06:06.720
A select few gnomes are born with it,
and it can't be ranked up.

06:09.072 --> 06:13.168
They're a strange bunch who live to research Jobs.

06:14.240 --> 06:17.376
I shall open a new door for thee.

06:17.680 --> 06:18.912
- So what are you going to do?

06:18.912 --> 06:19.600
- Thou whom desirest great power…
- So what are you going to do?

06:19.600 --> 06:20.624
- Thou whom desirest great power…

06:20.624 --> 06:21.264
- Thou whom desirest great power…
- You have a rank-up mark, don't you?

06:21.264 --> 06:21.680
- You have a rank-up mark, don't you?

06:21.680 --> 06:22.608
- Turn thine eyes to the sea within thee.
- You have a rank-up mark, don't you?

06:22.608 --> 06:22.800
- Turn thine eyes to the sea within thee.

06:22.800 --> 06:24.272
- Turn thine eyes to the sea within thee.
- Oh, this?

06:24.272 --> 06:24.688
- Turn thine eyes to the sea within thee.

06:24.688 --> 06:25.312
- Turn thine eyes to the sea within thee.
- This marking appears
when you're ready to rank up.

06:25.312 --> 06:28.912
- This marking appears
when you're ready to rank up.

06:29.328 --> 06:32.272
It's usually on your chest
or the back of your hand.

06:33.695 --> 06:37.936
But I hope yours is on your butt. That'd be cute.

06:39.085 --> 06:40.784
Give me a break.

06:41.765 --> 06:45.664
Congratulations. Your rank up is complete.

06:47.024 --> 06:49.200
I can feel the power inside me!

06:49.616 --> 06:51.408
Are you planning to be an Assassin?

06:51.856 --> 06:53.392
I haven't decided.

06:53.554 --> 06:55.888
Would you prefer if I became an Assassin?

06:56.164 --> 06:59.568
I'm not sure. It would give you
better fighting power…

07:00.148 --> 07:02.832
But it depends what other party members we get.

07:04.752 --> 07:06.864
We'll have more?

07:07.264 --> 07:09.760
Yeah. At least one more.

07:10.368 --> 07:14.112
It would be too reckless
for just us two to go into an Abyss.

07:16.441 --> 07:19.696
So I'd appreciate if you hold off for now.

07:20.490 --> 07:23.840
Let's just look into what Jobs
would be best to rank up into today.

07:24.704 --> 07:25.472
Gotcha.

07:30.112 --> 07:32.256
Where do we go nexsht?

07:32.400 --> 07:36.256
An arms shop run by a dwarf chief.

07:36.736 --> 07:40.544
Good weapons and armor
bring a Seeker to their full potential.

07:41.344 --> 07:44.368
That's why you can't skip out
on routine maintenance.

07:51.344 --> 07:52.688
Hey, chief!

07:55.248 --> 07:56.912
If it isn't Noel!

07:58.384 --> 08:01.248
You must be Blue Beyond's new…

08:01.711 --> 08:03.401
What do we have here?

08:06.528 --> 08:08.960
Now those are powerful.

08:12.704 --> 08:15.584
Next is the skill guide shop.

08:16.048 --> 08:19.392
They sell instruction manuals
on how to learn skills.

08:19.979 --> 08:21.712
She's a C-Rank Scout.

08:22.624 --> 08:24.352
Show her some books you have.

08:24.736 --> 08:25.776
One moment, please.

08:26.320 --> 08:27.296
Thanks.

08:28.272 --> 08:29.648
You're not looking, Noel?

08:29.856 --> 08:34.080
Nope. Different shops sell
skill books for different Jobs.

08:34.368 --> 08:37.392
I'm going to look in another shop.
Let's meet up later.

08:37.616 --> 08:38.864
Alright.

08:42.272 --> 08:44.144
The budget is one million fil.

08:44.672 --> 08:45.104
Okay.

08:45.744 --> 08:47.504
We're only getting books.

08:47.713 --> 08:48.288
Okay.

08:48.448 --> 08:50.000
Don't waste it.

08:50.177 --> 08:50.752
Okay.

08:56.370 --> 08:58.128
Great job wasting it.

08:58.238 --> 08:59.888
I didn't waste it!

09:00.592 --> 09:06.112
Armor Piercing. A ranged skill
that halves the enemy's defense.

09:06.640 --> 09:08.544
Eight hundred thousand fil.

09:09.024 --> 09:12.471
And a teddy bear to hold at night in place of you.

09:12.613 --> 09:14.432
Two hundred thousand fil.

09:14.832 --> 09:18.272
One million fil in total! A perfect haul!

09:18.728 --> 09:20.640
Did you not get anything?

09:21.088 --> 09:24.016
No. It was a bit over budget.

09:24.976 --> 09:29.616
A skill to return Undead to
their graves in an instant. Exorcism.

09:30.049 --> 09:32.080
Priced at thirty million fil.

09:33.136 --> 09:34.304
That's a bit much.

09:39.472 --> 09:40.304
What's wrong?

09:40.784 --> 09:43.408
I have something to do. I'll be back.

09:43.952 --> 09:45.200
Go ahead and eat without me.

09:46.224 --> 09:47.792
Hold on…

09:49.424 --> 09:51.680
But we're having a date today.

09:52.224 --> 09:52.784
Right?

09:57.824 --> 09:59.248
Over here, boss.

10:03.504 --> 10:04.384
Loki.

10:05.561 --> 10:07.952
Why'd you come into this dump?

10:08.295 --> 10:10.752
We could do business elsewhere.

10:11.008 --> 10:13.344
I want compensation if
the smell sticks to my clothes.

10:13.760 --> 10:15.168
Sorry, boss.

10:15.776 --> 10:18.272
But you know I'm on a tightrope here.

10:18.752 --> 10:20.768
Gotta stay away from watchful eyes.

10:21.712 --> 10:24.832
Here's what you asked for. Info on the convict.

10:25.936 --> 10:28.560
But are you sure about this, boss?

10:29.120 --> 10:32.192
Do you really want the murderer
who shook the capital,

10:32.864 --> 10:36.976
the Puppeteer Hugo Coppelia, to join your party?

10:38.144 --> 10:39.440
Yeah. I'm sure.

10:39.664 --> 10:43.152
Also, I'm convinced that Hugo is innocent.

10:43.568 --> 10:47.696
That's why I'm having you dig up info to prove it.

10:48.176 --> 10:49.632
Well, sure…

10:50.016 --> 10:54.240
But selling your party members as slaves
and freeing a convict from death row…

10:54.672 --> 10:56.576
You sure are twisted.

10:57.478 --> 10:59.568
I'll take that as a compliment.

11:00.224 --> 11:02.128
Good work as always.

11:02.528 --> 11:04.906
You really are the best informant in the capital.

11:04.907 --> 11:07.536
They don't call you Faceless for nothing.

11:08.028 --> 11:09.452
Thanks, boss.

11:11.078 --> 11:12.920
My Job is Imitator.

11:14.000 --> 11:16.352
Whoever I want to look like…

11:17.024 --> 11:18.096
I can turn into them.

11:21.248 --> 11:23.920
There's nowhere I can't sneak into.

11:24.272 --> 11:25.088
So I gather.

11:25.584 --> 11:29.072
It's a rare Job the Appraiser Association
doesn't have a good understanding of.

11:30.064 --> 11:33.168
I can't even be sure if this is the real you.

11:34.752 --> 11:37.600
Here's the payment. Continue investigating for me.

11:38.160 --> 11:38.912
My pleasure!

11:40.016 --> 11:42.912
Right. I have a bonus tip for you.

11:44.592 --> 11:48.224
There's a dangerous drug
going around in these parts.

11:48.821 --> 11:49.984
A dangerous drug?

11:50.624 --> 11:55.408
They say the high is incredible, but
one of the side effects is uncontrollable rage.

11:55.904 --> 11:59.088
Probably why there's been more violence lately.

11:59.648 --> 12:04.240
But the Luciano family won't let
such a disruptive substance spread for long.

12:05.024 --> 12:06.624
What idiot is selling the stuff?

12:07.136 --> 12:12.768
Actually, it's one of the branches
of the Luciano family.

12:13.168 --> 12:14.944
So they won't get in trouble for it.

12:15.296 --> 12:18.160
If I recall, the branch based here is…

12:18.899 --> 12:20.387
The Gambino family.

12:21.235 --> 12:22.899
Their boss is Albert Gambino.

12:24.254 --> 12:26.686
He's supposed to be a nasty fellow.

12:30.028 --> 12:33.008
[V - Swordsman of the Far East]

12:35.184 --> 12:36.912
Noel, you dummy.

12:37.168 --> 12:39.856
Leaving your sister high and dry like that.

12:45.328 --> 12:48.432
You don't get how girls work at all!

12:49.024 --> 12:49.840
Alma?

12:55.984 --> 12:57.248
The Gambino family.

12:58.499 --> 13:03.123
I heard their boss just died unexpectedly
and his son took over.

13:04.784 --> 13:05.952
Awful stuff.

13:07.664 --> 13:10.144
The old boss was a traditional gentleman.

13:10.707 --> 13:13.075
Even Finocchio respected him.

13:13.824 --> 13:17.072
He wouldn't have allowed anyone
to sell dangerous drugs.

13:20.608 --> 13:22.592
I don't see faces like that around here often.

13:23.264 --> 13:24.736
Is he an immigrant from far away?

13:26.832 --> 13:27.824
Poor guy.

13:28.366 --> 13:30.846
I can't imagine ending up
as a beggar in a foreign country.

13:31.472 --> 13:34.320
He's young. He must have had hopes and dreams.

13:42.864 --> 13:44.048
Hey. Wait up.

13:46.512 --> 13:49.232
You dropped a coin.

13:50.096 --> 13:50.528
Here.

13:53.136 --> 13:57.024
Hold onto it better so you don't drop it again.

13:57.613 --> 13:58.735
No…

13:59.264 --> 14:04.048
And this ain't a safe place
for a pretty young lady like you.

14:04.528 --> 14:06.336
You better get out of here.

14:09.120 --> 14:12.160
What's that look for? Got a bellyache?

14:12.848 --> 14:17.136
Firstly… Just to get this out there,
I'm not a lady. I'm a man.

14:17.776 --> 14:20.960
You're a man?! My bad…

14:21.258 --> 14:23.450
And I don't want that money anymore.

14:23.948 --> 14:28.544
I don't want to put it in my wallet
after a filthy man like you touched it.

14:28.928 --> 14:30.704
What did you say?!

14:30.752 --> 14:32.240
Do what you want with it.

14:34.704 --> 14:36.544
Hey! Wait!

14:39.536 --> 14:40.832
Don't touch me.

14:41.232 --> 14:42.608
Know your place.

14:42.768 --> 14:45.616
You're not even worth one silver coin.

14:53.856 --> 14:55.072
You bastard…

14:56.224 --> 14:58.608
You've done it now.

14:59.680 --> 15:01.664
I don't like fightin' much,

15:02.368 --> 15:06.368
but I'm no chump who
won't stick up for himself either.

15:09.248 --> 15:11.600
That stance… He's no amateur.

15:12.672 --> 15:14.672
Last chance to say sorry.

15:15.142 --> 15:17.824
Why would I say sorry, moron?

15:18.160 --> 15:21.120
I see. In that case…

15:22.624 --> 15:24.304
Go to hell!

15:29.040 --> 15:29.920
You…!

15:41.456 --> 15:43.792
Those are some frightening moves.

15:44.448 --> 15:46.320
You a ninja?

15:47.216 --> 15:52.400
Ninja. A Scout-like Job that only exists
in islands to the far east.

15:53.056 --> 15:55.584
Does that mean this man is from there?

15:56.112 --> 15:58.928
I'm not a Ninja. I'm a Talker.

15:59.504 --> 16:01.648
A Talker? You?

16:02.192 --> 16:03.648
Well, it doesn't matter.

16:04.480 --> 16:06.976
I can tell you're strong.

16:07.632 --> 16:08.976
In that case…

16:10.832 --> 16:13.632
Lemme use a skill of my own.

16:14.560 --> 16:15.840
This man…

16:18.832 --> 16:20.112
…is a score!

16:20.688 --> 16:22.592
He's obviously strong.

16:22.880 --> 16:24.976
If he lives up to my expectations…

16:26.162 --> 16:29.824
Sorry for my rudeness. You've piqued my interest.

16:30.144 --> 16:32.080
Let's get serious.

16:32.464 --> 16:35.312
If you want to live, then don't hold back!

16:36.336 --> 16:37.968
That's my line!

16:43.904 --> 16:45.904
Hey! Koga!

16:46.704 --> 16:49.360
What do you think you're doing?!

16:49.648 --> 16:50.432
Koga!

16:50.432 --> 16:56.064
I told you to be patient,
and now you're waving a stick around!

16:57.216 --> 16:59.744
So you haven't ranked up yet.

17:00.224 --> 17:03.600
No. There are four options for a Scout to rank up.

17:04.848 --> 17:05.693
Assassin or Torturer on the front line,
or Chaser or Bandit on the back line.

17:05.694 --> 17:06.446
[Assassin]
Assassin or Torturer on the front line,
or Chaser or Bandit on the back line.

17:06.447 --> 17:08.457
[Assassin] [Torturer]
Assassin or Torturer on the front line,
or Chaser or Bandit on the back line.

17:08.458 --> 17:09.281
[Assassin] [Torturer]
[Chaser]
Assassin or Torturer on the front line,
or Chaser or Bandit on the back line.

17:09.282 --> 17:10.000
[Assassin] [Torturer]
[Chaser] [Bandit]
Assassin or Torturer on the front line,
or Chaser or Bandit on the back line.

17:10.000 --> 17:10.544
[Assassin] [Torturer]
[Chaser] [Bandit]

17:10.544 --> 17:16.432
[Assassin] [Torturer]
[Chaser] [Bandit]
I checked at the Appraiser Association, and they
said I would be best as an Assassin or Chaser.

17:16.832 --> 17:20.576
Frontline or backline… That's a hard choice.

17:21.008 --> 17:23.456
It affects your chemistry
with other party members.

17:23.632 --> 17:27.408
That's what Noel said. So I'm holding off.

17:27.744 --> 17:28.704
That makes sense.

17:29.104 --> 17:32.416
Oh! That might be what Noel is busy with now.

17:32.880 --> 17:33.776
What do you mean?

17:34.192 --> 17:36.176
Finding new members.

17:39.392 --> 17:42.832
What if you caught the police's eyes, huh?!

17:43.136 --> 17:46.208
Miguel… This isn't, uh…

17:46.624 --> 17:48.160
No excuses!

17:48.336 --> 17:51.488
You know there are consequences for disobeying me!

17:51.536 --> 17:55.007
A-Anything but that! Please! Don't…!

17:55.085 --> 17:56.928
Ring, restrain him!

18:03.024 --> 18:04.656
An Oath of Subordination.

18:05.200 --> 18:09.440
A contract item where the ring holder
has absolute authority over the signer.

18:10.220 --> 18:15.424
It's normally illegal to use it on another person,
with one exception.

18:17.344 --> 18:20.672
If it's a master and a slave.

18:22.800 --> 18:24.192
You worthless slave.

18:24.272 --> 18:27.408
You brought this on yourself by disobeying me.

18:27.840 --> 18:30.272
And who are you?

18:30.512 --> 18:33.264
It seemed like you were scuffling with my Koga.

18:33.968 --> 18:38.736
What business does a pretty lady
like you have here?

18:39.424 --> 18:42.192
I'd like to hear more about it.

18:42.192 --> 18:44.288
Don't worry. I don't bite.

18:44.513 --> 18:46.593
I'm a gentleman.

18:46.752 --> 18:48.352
I'll just…

18:51.712 --> 18:55.120
You… You bitch! What'd you just do to me?!

18:55.568 --> 18:57.648
Watch your language.

18:58.224 --> 19:01.056
Just answer my questions.

19:01.776 --> 19:02.544
Got it?

19:04.400 --> 19:07.232
I've never heard your accent before.
Where are you from?

19:07.456 --> 19:11.248
A-A town called Soldiland way down south.

19:11.696 --> 19:15.664
You don't look like a trader.
What are you doing in the capital?

19:16.432 --> 19:18.576
W-Well…

19:18.864 --> 19:19.600
Answer me.

19:19.760 --> 19:21.820
I-I will!

19:21.820 --> 19:25.376
The truth is… I couldn't stay in my town!

19:25.648 --> 19:26.288
Why not?

19:27.200 --> 19:32.493
I was running an underground
fighting ring for the d'Alembert family.

19:32.592 --> 19:37.393
But I got caught pocketing
the boss's bribe money, so…

19:37.488 --> 19:39.840
You ran to the capital.

19:40.384 --> 19:41.952
Pretty much.

19:42.550 --> 19:48.496
If you run to a higher-ranked family's turf,
the d'Alemberts can't touch you.

19:49.950 --> 19:51.406
Crafty idea you got there.

19:53.344 --> 19:55.520
New members…

19:56.352 --> 20:00.960
Yeah. His recruitment bulletin
is still posted in town.

20:01.616 --> 20:04.224
Maybe someone contacted him.

20:05.520 --> 20:10.336
Normally people wouldn't ditch
a date because of that, though.

20:10.788 --> 20:13.492
But knowing Noel…

20:14.741 --> 20:16.325
So he's your gladiator?

20:16.752 --> 20:21.472
Yes. I bought him and trained him up myself.

20:21.824 --> 20:24.320
I took him with me when I ran, 'cause he's mine.

20:24.752 --> 20:25.760
I see.

20:26.496 --> 20:31.280
So you intended to have him fight in a ring
in the capital, keep the winnings for yourself,

20:31.648 --> 20:36.432
and maybe make a comeback
in underground fighting if you're lucky.

20:36.784 --> 20:39.728
Heh, you figured me out.

20:40.144 --> 20:45.168
Oh, do you happen to be involved
in the scene, miss?

20:45.440 --> 20:49.296
Sorry, but no. I'm just a Seeker.

20:50.160 --> 20:54.544
And I should have corrected you
earlier, but I'm a man.

20:57.136 --> 21:01.023
A Seeker?! And… a man?!

21:01.120 --> 21:06.080
Don't act so shocked! It's pissing me off!
That last part especially!

21:07.074 --> 21:09.440
I'm sorry! I'm so sorry!

21:10.752 --> 21:14.576
He could be talking up some
ambitious rookie as we speak.

21:14.960 --> 21:18.432
He really doesn't get how girls work.

21:22.400 --> 21:24.112
It's no big deal.

21:26.128 --> 21:28.336
What now?

21:29.328 --> 21:32.768
He may be connected to the d'Alembert family…

21:33.264 --> 21:34.768
But he's a wanted man.

21:35.232 --> 21:38.176
I wouldn't get on anyone's
bad side if I killed him.

21:39.424 --> 21:42.816
And once he's out of the picture…

21:44.208 --> 21:48.768
But I want to be the only one at Noel's side.

21:49.152 --> 21:50.400
If there were anyone else…

21:54.608 --> 21:57.024
That man is mine.

21:58.192 --> 22:00.320
I'll kill them.

23:35.020 --> 23:40.071
[VI - The Value of Pride]
